OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set in caravan park
OL,4,Amurder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a woman who was
OL,8,Ffound inside a caravan.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police was called to
OL,11,FOverstone Lakes in Sywell at about
OL,12,F06:20 BST on Monday, 24 August
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of an assault.
OL,15,FSusan Lumsden, 62, who was described as
OL,16,Fbeing "caring and incredibly kind", was
OL,17,Ffound inside a caravan at the holiday
OL,18,Fpark on Ecton Lane.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
