OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set in caravan park
OL,4,Amurder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Brian Lewis, 72, of Cherrytree
OL,7,FWalk on the caravan park, appeared at
OL,8,FNorthampton Crown Court on Tuesday and
OL,9,Fwas remanded into custody. A plea
OL,10,Fhearing is due on 23 October with a
OL,11,Ftrial date at the same court scheduled
OL,12,Ffor 1 February.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
